  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The angry men are mapped as 'muslims who are offended by jokes'",
  "description": "The top text 'jokes don't kill people' is juxtaposed with the visual of angry men, who are then explicitly mapped by the bottom text 'muslims who are offended by jokes kill people'. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity (group_of_men) is being identified as the group described in the text (muslims who are offended by jokes). The visual material (angry_men_protest) is thus mapped onto the textual description (joke_offense_stereotype) to imply that this group is responsible for violence.",
